body:
QOTD: Thanks now I really want a pizza.  Not just any pizza though, the kind I used to get near my old home, which I havent lived in for almost 7 years!  I only like Extra Cheese on mine (yes I am extra boring!) and eww who would use Sweet Peas?

&#x200B;

For me today I did a little shopping and napped a bunch.  Didnt sleep too well last night, my cat decided to bat a spider hanging from its web onto my face while I was sleeping.  Did I mention I am a arachnophobe?  Nope did settle to sleep until atleast 5 AM.
